Return exactly one JSON object and no other text.

Language requirements:
- JSON keys stay in English.
- All user-facing natural language values must be Chinese, including `summary`, every finding `title`, `detail`, and `suggestion`.
- If source evidence, code identifiers, file paths, exception names, SQL names, or protocol fields are English, keep those exact technical terms but explain the issue in Chinese.
- Do not output English finding titles or English-only finding details.

```json
{
  "summary": "一句中文总结",
  "pass_check": true,
  "score": 100,
  "findings": [
    {
      "file": "relative/path",
      "line": 123,
      "severity": "fatal|high|medium|low|info",
      "title": "简短中文问题标题",
      "detail": "用中文说明为什么这是有变更行证据支撑的真实问题",
      "suggestion": "中文修复建议"
    }
  ]
}
```

Precision rules:
- Report only issues directly evidenced by changed lines in the inline diff.
- Prefer an empty `findings` array over speculative comments.
- `pass_check` must be `false` when any finding has severity `fatal`, `high`, or `medium`; otherwise `true`.
- `score` is 100 for no findings, 90-99 for low/info-only findings, 70-89 for medium findings, 40-69 for high findings, and below 40 for fatal findings.

